 ## Background
-This method is described in the thesis "New Techniques for Out-Of-Core Visualization of Large Datasets" by Wagner Correa [S1, unofficial]. It builds upon the vertex clustering algorithm by Rossignac and Borrel [112] and adapts it for the specific needs of out-of-core volume rendering, where I/O efficiency and robustness are paramount. The approach was selected to provide a fast, reliable way to generate LODs for large datasets that are often already triangulated.
